  "findings": [
    "Exact dcf36133 primary source shows existing routed shapes become initial routing, first encoded FIXED path marks a fixed frNet, and the writer preserves FIXED wires. Independent audits remain mandatory because access points/top-layer BTerm handling still occurs.",
    "Actual dbGuide API shape matches getBox/getNet/getLayer/isCongested. At least one in-range, noncongested saved guide ensures the native tmp_guides map is nonempty; missing or invalid guide evidence rejects before the route attempt.",
    "Complete 143820-net ownership admits only existing ROUTED, unselected SIGNAL nets. Selected 1691 clocks, non-SIGNAL and unwired records, all non-NETS bytes, connections, placement, BTerm/NDR projection, instantiated master pin decomposed boxes and union of used-via definitions remain protected.",
    "Selected clocks stay metadata and encoded FIXED during the sole route; original metadata and path classes are restored through qualified paired imports before original1691 gate and final full read-only DRT.",
    "Final DRT requires actual uncapped native direct/category counts, exact complete serialized hierarchy/count/cap/source equality and byte-identical native TR reexport; missing and explicit zero remain distinct. Nonzero results are preserved with RC/STA ineligible.",
    "Full saved107-file clock archive and saved global guide/config transport are hash-admitted before native use. Expanded extraction selection and inherited report OUT globals are restored in finally.",
    "Qualified exact-source reserved publisher is retained; injected transport/publication errors preserve the original exception and shared globals. Read-only reservation waiter precedes runtime setup.",
    "Authored controls exercise actual ownership/delta/native API shape/Tcl/driver-order/restoration and publisher functions, with inherited archive/classification/marker controls; no authored control was executed by this reviewer.",
    "Original 20/4/8/8 ns plus5% timing contract remains; no STA, RC, electrical or full-PHY acceptance is inferred."
  ],
  "base_blocker": "Root found the route-phase 1200-second limit below the prior completed final route segment; final clearance requires the separate routing-only budget correction.",
